OL,3,GNEWSACompany fined #450,000 after
OL,4,Aelectrocution death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company has been fined #450,000 after
OL,7,Fa guttering engineer died after being
OL,8,Felectrocuted by an overhead power line
OL,9,Fwhilst at work.
OL,11,FAndrew Claridge, from Minster Lovell,
OL,12,Fdied at a property in Longworth, near
OL,13,FAbingdon, on 14 November 2024, Thames
OL,14,FValley Police (TVP) said.
OL,16,FCotswold Rainwater Services Ltd, of
OL,17,FNorthfield Farm Lane, Witney,
OL,18,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to one count
OL,19,Fof corporate manslaughter in connection
OL,20,Fwith the death.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
