OL,3,GNEWSACompany fined #450,000 after
OL,4,Aelectrocution death
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a sentencing hearing at Oxford
OL,7,FCrown Court on Friday, the firm was
OL,8,Ffined #450,000 and ordered to pay
OL,9,F#15,735 in costs as well as a #2,000
OL,10,Fvictim surcharge.
